    {
      "source": "Extension for <a href=\"../../spring-webflux/org.springframework.web.reactive.function.client/-web-client/-response-spec/to-entity.html\">WebClient.ResponseSpec.toEntity</a> providing a <code class=\"lang-kotlin\">toEntity&lt;Foo&gt;()</code> variant leveraging Kotlin reified type parameters and allows <a href=\"https://kotlinlang.org/api/core/kotlin-stdlib/kotlin.coroutines/-coroutine-context/index.html\">kotlin.coroutines.CoroutineContext</a> propagation to the <a href=\"-co-exchange-filter-function/index.html\">CoExchangeFilterFunction</a>. This extension is not subject to type erasure and retains actual generic type arguments.",
      "translation": "针对 `<a href=\"../../spring-webflux/org.springframework.web.reactive.function.client/-web-client/-response-spec/to-entity.html\">WebClient.ResponseSpec.toEntity</a>` 的扩展，提供利用 Kotlin 重封类型参数的 `<code class=\"lang-kotlin\">toEntity&lt;Foo&gt;()</code>` 变体，并允许将 `<a href=\"https://kotlinlang.org/api/core/kotlin-stdlib/kotlin.coroutines/-coroutine-context/index.html\">kotlin.coroutines.CoroutineContext</a>` 传播到 `<a href=\"-co-exchange-filter-function/index.html\">CoExchangeFilterFunction</a>`。此扩展不受类型擦除影响，并保留实际的泛型类型参数。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
